; Test: Superiority relations
; Coverage: simple prefer, resolving conflicts

; Classic penguin: bird flies, penguin doesn't, penguin > bird
(given bird)
(given penguin)
(normally r1 bird flies)
(normally r2 penguin (not flies))
(prefer r2 r1)

; EXPECT: +D bird
; EXPECT: +d bird
; EXPECT: +D penguin
; EXPECT: +d penguin
; EXPECT: +d ~flies
; EXPECT: -d flies
